          <div>
            <h1 class="ru-h1">Your app has a name.<span class="c-gray"> Use it.</span></h1>
            <p class="ru-lede">
              routeup gives every app on your machine a stable, browser-trusted HTTPS name, so you can use the same URL every time.
            </p>
            <ul class="ru-hero-points">
              <li><strong>Local by default</strong><span>{' '}Routes stay on your machine with no account, token, or server.</span></li>
              <li><strong>Bring or run the app</strong><span>{' '}Proxy an app you already start, or let routeup run its configured command.</span></li>
              <li><strong>Inspect and debug</strong><span>{' '}Follow status and timing live, with opt-in capture for headers and bodies.</span></li>
              <li><strong>Expose when needed</strong><span>{' '}Open only the routes or paths you choose through a hosted or self-hosted server.</span></li>
            </ul>

            <div class="ru-ctas">
