            Install the single binary, run setup once, then give each project a route.
          </p>
          <div class="ru-install-grid">
            <article class="ru-install-card">
              <div class="ru-install-card__heading">
                <p class="ru-install-card__tag">Homebrew</p>
                <h3>macOS or Linux</h3>
