              <div class="ru-setup-term" translate="no" tabindex="0"><pre class="ru-pre"><span class="c-mint">$ </span><span class="c-txt">routeup setup</span>

<span class="c-mint">  ✓  certificate authority   created</span>
<span class="c-mint">  ✓  certificate             trusted</span>
<span class="c-mint">  ✓  port 443                ready</span>
